<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rutherford-Moran started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rutherford-Moran started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Rutherford-Moran Oil Corp with an outperform rating, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst David Wheeler was not immediately available to provide details.</p>
<p>-- Rutherford-Moran closed Thursday at 19-1/2.</p>
